{"seq":48,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r2-2026-11/hermes-opus-gbrain-told-live-er-l3-mu-v04-dev/er-11-l3-tansley-parcel-contact/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T17:23:45.371Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"d6114a112ef99e74fb8678d5210a8680b4982fef6329cdd32f304e8c56c48003","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hollis, on 14 Oct you told me your go-to escalation contact at Tansley Parcel for the Marlowe rollout is now Idris Brevik, so he's who I'd call. Two things to check first: Soren Tolland, the other contact you gave me, is for Tansleigh Packaging (Bittern rollout), not Tansley Parcel. And Pree owns the Tansley Parcel account. In earlier team threads Lev Arkadin was her day-to-day contact there, so you may want to give her a heads-up too. I don't have a phone number for Idris in anything I can see."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792591200.000133"}}
